   "title": "Philly DSA Building Trades Meeting",
   "start": "2026-11-09T18:00:00-05:00",
   "source": "phillydsa",
   "source_name": "Philly DSA",
   "end": "2026-11-09T19:30:00-05:00",
   "all_day": false,
   "venue": "The Pub on Passyunk East",
   "address": "1501 Passyunk Ave, Philadelphia, PA 19147",
   "url": "https://www.phillydsa.org/events",
   "description": "<h5><strong>More Info and RSVP:</strong></h5>\n    <p><a href=\"https://actionnetwork.org/events/philly-dsa-building-trades-meeting\">https://actionnetwork.org/events/philly-dsa-building-trades-meeting</a></p>\n    \n    <h5><strong>Description:</strong></h5>\n    <p>Do you work in Philadelphia\u2019s building trades? Are you a socialist, or just someone who thinks the system isn\u2019t working for us? Join us November 9th starting at 6 PM at the Pub on Passyunk East, for an open-ended discussion on the relationship between our politics and our work. We will review recent unions' contract battles and the landscape of orgnanization within the trades generally. What is necessary for us to fight back and demand more, and how do we get there?</p><div><p>This event is organized by the Labor Committee of the Philadelphia Democratic Socialists of America, but any curious building trades workers are welcome to attend!</p></div><div></div><div><div><div><div><div><div></div></div></div></div></div></div>",
   "price": "",
