   "venue": "The People's Headquarters (PHQ)",
   "address": "924 Cherry Street, Philadelphia, PA 19107",
   "url": "https://www.phillydsa.org/events",
   "description": "<h5><strong>More Info and RSVP:</strong></h5>\n    <p><a href=\"https://actionnetwork.org/events/night-school-imperialism-101\">https://actionnetwork.org/events/night-school-imperialism-101</a></p>\n    \n    <h5><strong>Description:</strong></h5>\n    <p>\"Imperialism is the highest stage of capitalism.\" V. Lenin</p><p>This session will provide an introduction to the broader ideas of imperialism, national domination, and what colonialism looks like in the 21st century.<font> We'll also explore the role socialist countries play in the anti-imperialist struggle and look at how peoples across history and around the globe have used resistance and rebellion to fight back. </font></p>",
