   "venue": "MOTW Coffee and Pastries",
   "address": "2101 Market St, Philadelphia, PA 19103",
   "url": "https://www.phillydsa.org/events",
   "description": "<h5><strong>More Info and RSVP:</strong></h5>\n    <p><a href=\"https://actionnetwork.org/events/philly-dsa-healthcare-workers-meetup\">https://actionnetwork.org/events/philly-dsa-healthcare-workers-meetup</a></p>\n    \n    <h5><strong>Description:</strong></h5>\n    <p>Do you work in Philadelphia\u2019s healthcare industry? Are you a socialist, or just someone who thinks the system isn\u2019t working for us and our patients? Join us November 13th starting at 7 PM at MOTW Coffee and Pastries, for an open-ended discussion on the relationship between our politics and our work. We will review recent nurses' contract battles before a discussion on perspectives for healthcare fights going forward with the Medicaid cuts hanging over our heads. What is necessary for us to fight back and demand more, and how do we get there?</p><p>This event is organized by the Labor Committee of the Philadelphia Democratic Socialists of America, but any curious healthcare professionals are welcome to attend!</p>",
